  "chitchat": [
    "\"Anybody can point a plane at the sky. Landing it's the exam.\"",
    "\"Yoke's inverted. Pull back to climb. Learn it now, not at fifty feet.\"",
    "\"I've signed off worse pilots than you. A few of them even came back.\""
  ],
  "description": "A trim, silver-haired woman in a faded flight instructor's jacket, a clipboard tucked under one arm and a headset slung round her neck. She watches the ramp the way a surgeon watches a heartbeat monitor: patient, unblinking, cataloguing every twitch. The wings stitched over her breast pocket are worn to threads.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "accepted": {
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "START_CHECKRIDE"
        }
      ],
      "options": [],
      "text": "\"Then quit talking and start flying.\" She walks you out to a trainer Mayfly idling on the ramp and folds herself into the seat beside you. \"Follow my calls. Try not to embarrass either of us.\""
    },
    "already": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Just checking in.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"You're already rated. I signed your ticket myself. Sky's yours. Don't make me regret it.\""
    },
    "bye": {
      "options": [],
      "text": "She gives a curt nod and goes back to watching the ramp."
    },
    "offer": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "I'm ready. Let's go.",
          "next": "accepted"
        },
        {
          "label": "Not just yet.",
          "next": "bye"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"A checkride. You'll fly a trainer Mayfly off my ramp, thread a course of rings I'll throw up in front of you. Climb, turn, come around, and grease her back onto Coldwater Regional, Grade B or better. Bend the aircraft and we start over; the trainers are free and I've a hangar of them. Two things before you strap in: the ENGINE switch lights her up, and the yoke is INVERTED, so drag DOWN to pull back and climb. Everybody forgets that one. Once.\""
    },
    "root": {
      "options": [
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "air_pilot_licensed",
              "op": "unset",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "I want my pilot's licence.",
          "next": "offer"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "air_pilot_licensed",
              "op": "set",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "Good to be rated.",
          "next": "already"
        },
        {
          "label": "How do these things fly?",
          "next": "tips"
        }
      ],
      "text": "The silver-haired woman clocks you the moment you step onto the hangar floor. \"Looking to fly? Nobody takes the pilot seat around here until they've flown a checkride with me. Name's Reyes. I decide who gets to leave the ground.\""
    },
    "tips": {
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Got it.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Throttle's on A and Z. Steer with the yoke: left and right to bank, and remember she's inverted: down to climb, up to descend. Keep your speed up in the turns, ease it down on final. The rings tell you where; the horizon tells you how.\""
    }
  },
